# basePath Overarching

:: BeforeEvaluation.1
@trigger    BeforeContractEvaluation
@cutscene
{@PAL}  Let's see how our routes play out...

:: BeforeEvaluation.Risky.1
@trigger    BeforeContractEvaluation
@when   risk > 4
@cutscene
{@PAL}  Not sure about this...

:: BeforeEvaluation.Risky.2
@trigger    BeforeContractEvaluation
@when   risk > 8
@cutscene
{@PAL}  Locke... Are we sure about this...

:: AfterEvaluation.1
@trigger    AfterContractEvaluation
@when   !encounteredHazard
@cutscene
{@PAL}  Everything went smoothly!

:: AfterEvaluation.HazardTimeMoney.1
@trigger    AfterContractEvaluation
@when   encounteredHazard, timeLost > 0, moneyLost > 0
@cutscene
{@PAL}  Unfortunately our haulers ran into hazards. This resulted in lost time and will cost us more.

:: AfterEvaluation.HazardTime.1
@trigger    AfterContractEvaluation
@when   encounteredHazard, timeLost > 0, moneyLost == 0
@cutscene
{@PAL}  Unfortunately our haulers ran into hazards. This resulted in lost time.

:: AfterEvaluation.HazardMoney.1
@trigger    AfterContractEvaluation
@when   encounteredHazard, timeLost == 0, moneyLost > 0
@cutscene
{@PAL}  Unfortunately our haulers ran into hazards. This will cost us more.